[node name="Tutorialtext ET" type="Label" parent="help/CenterContainer/HBoxContainer"]
visible = false
layout_mode = 2
text = "Sinu eesmärk on luua vajalikke varuosi, et oma kosmoselaeva parandada.
See eesmärk on nähtaval kosmoselaeva peal, et seda täita pead 
konveierite abil vajalikke osi sinna sisestama.

Et luua neid komponente pead ehitama tehase, mis iseenesest kaevandab
ja rafineerib tooreid resursse, nagu raud, koostamismasinates.

Ehitisi saab ehitada vajutades B nuppu, see paneb sind ülalvaates
olevasse ehitusrežiimi. Ehitisi saab valida kas vajutades
numbreid 1-5 või oma inventarist vajutades ehitiste peale.
Inventari saab avada vajutades E nuppu.

Vajutades backspace või vastava ehitise numbri peale saad
eemaldada oma ehitise valiku. Kui sul pole ehitis valitud 
ehitusrežiimis, saad ehitatud ehitiste peale vajutada, mis teeb
nende konteineri lahti. Ehitise konteinerist saad võtta tooteid, või
kui ehitis kasutab retsepte, saad seda määrata nende peale vajutades.

Ehitised võtavad konveieritelt, või teistelt ehitistelt vastu tooteid
igalt küljelt, kuid väljutavad neid ainult punasega märgitud kohast, mis
on nähtaval ehitise ehitamisel. \"Jagaja\" ehitisel võib olla kuni 3 
väljutuskohta.

Sul on võimalik võtta ehitisest tooteid kui avad selle konteineri ning
vajutad kaks korda toote peale. Sul on ka võimalik oma inventarist asju
meisterdada nt konveiereid, kui sul on vajalikud koostisosad olemas.

WASD - liikumine
E - inventar
ESC - sulge menüü
SPACE - hüpe
B - ehitusrežiimi sisse-/väljalülitus
Vasak hiireklõps - ehita
Parem hiireklõps - eemalda ehitis
R - pööra päripäeva
numbrid 1-5 - vali ehitis (valida saab ka inventarist)
Backspace - tühista ehitise valik
F4 - lahku mängust

debug:
pgup - populate containers
pgdn - infinite building materials"
label_settings = SubResource("LabelSettings_8j60k")

[node name="Tutorialtext EN" type="Label" parent="help/CenterContainer/HBoxContainer"]
visible = false
layout_mode = 2
text = "Your goal is to create the necessary spare parts to repair your spaceship.
This objective is visible on the spaceship, to complete it, you must use
conveyors to insert the required parts into it.

To create these components, you need to build a factory that automatically
mines and refines raw resources, such as iron, in assembly machines.

Buildings can be constructed by pressing the B key, which switches you 
into top-down build mode. Buildings can be selected either by pressing
the number keys 1–5 or by clicking on buildings in your inventory. 
The inventory can be opened by pressing the E key.

By pressing Backspace or the corresponding building number, you can cancel your building selection.
If you do not have a building selected in build mode, you can click on already 
built structures to open their container.
From a building’s container, you can take products, or if the building 
uses recipes, you can assign them by clicking on them.

Buildings accept items from conveyors or other buildings from any side, 
but they only output items from the side marked in red, which is visible when placing the building.
The “Splitter” building can have up to three output points.

You can take products from a building by opening its container and double-clicking on the product. 
You can also craft items from your inventory, such as conveyors, if you have the required ingredients.

WASD – movement
E – inventory
ESC – close menu
SPACE – jump
B – toggle build mode
Left mouse click – build
Right mouse click – remove building
R – rotate clockwise
Numbers 1–5 – select building (can also be selected from inventory)
Backspace – cancel building selection
F4 – exit game

Debug:
Page Up – populate containers
Page Down – infinite building materials
"
